00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.535 size:88% position:44%
♫ 1, 2, 3, Think fast! ♫

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, now --

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was a good theme song
right there.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Here´s how it works --

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:09.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
We´re gonna take turns
drawing one of these cards.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
Each card has five totally
random questions on it.

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.380
One person asks the questions.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
The other person
has to answer each question

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:17.017 size:84% position:42%
as soon as it´s asked,
and I mean immediately.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Yep.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:19.686
It doesn´t matter
if the answer´s right or wrong,

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
just has to be
the very first thing

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
that pops in your head.
-Okay.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:24.057
-Will, because you´re the guest,
I´ll read the questions first,

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:25.625 size:84% position:42%
and you´ll answer them.
Are you ready for this?

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, I am.
-Here we go.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫♫

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Clock ticking ]

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
