00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.369 size:84% position:42%
-I was curling my hair.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-How do you make bananas?

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:39.973 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Growing them.

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.775 size:75% position:38%
-Who is Mr. Feldman?

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.209 size:75% position:38%
-Next door neighbor.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What does Santa Claus do
when he´s mad?

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Smokes a pipe.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:49.449 size:88% position:44%
-What´s a cool greeting?

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:51.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He-ey!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Ding! ]
-Fantastic. That´s correct.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s correct.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
You answered
all those correctly.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, great.
-He-ey!

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:01.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, now --
now it´s my turn.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.395 size:81% position:41%
Whenever you´re ready,

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
