and ask me the questions.

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:05.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:08.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫♫

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:09.869
