00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:10.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Everything.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Where is Eric?

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
-On the stairs!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:16.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What´s it called
