[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When is Thursday?

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wednesday.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Who do --
Why do you love me?

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.353 size:81% position:41%
-´Cause you´re cuddly.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:29.355
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Ding! ]

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:32.225 size:88% position:44%
-You got them all right.

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:33.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did get them
all right, as well?

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I got it wrong.
I said, "Who do you love me?"

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:36.729 size:78% position:39%
"Who do you love me?"
-Who do you love me?

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, Hootie loves me.
-Yeah.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.600
-That´s what I yell at the
Hootie and the Blowfish concert.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, now it´s time
for the final round,

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.138
and this round, we´ll both --

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:46.339 size:84% position:42%
-Wednesday is Thursday?

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:48.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, yeah.
Thursday´s Wednesday.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:49.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, okay.
-Yeah.

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.644
For this round,
we´re gonna both pick up a card.

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
Same set of questions,
and we´ll ask and answer them

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
