going back and forth, okay?

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And who asks first?
-I will start.

00:01:57.484 --> 00:01:59.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Here we go.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:00.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫♫

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
