[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.102 size:75% position:38%
-What´s for dessert?

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Crunches.

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:19.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
John, Paul, George,
